        <item>
            <title>1.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 01:39:03 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/jinkun1998/another.notch/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>37</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<div class="markdown-heading"><h1 class="heading-element">anotherNotch v1.3.0</h1><a id="user-content-anothernotch-v130" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: anotherNotch v1.3.0" href="#anothernotch-v130"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<div class="markdown-heading"><h2 class="heading-element">New Features</h2><a id="user-content-new-features" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: New Features" href="#new-features"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Fan Control Module</strong>: Telemetry monitoring (RPM, temp), manual/auto speed modes.</li>
<li>
<strong>Quick Notes Module</strong>: In-notch scratchpad, persistent storage, morphing delete button confirmation.</li>
<li>
<strong>Two-Sided Module Tabs</strong>: Home tab pinned left, utility modules clustered right.</li>
<li>
<strong>Multi-Language Support</strong>: Crowdin localization pipeline added. Initial support for English, Tiếng Việt, Español, Français, 简体中文.</li>
</ul>
<div class="markdown-heading"><h2 class="heading-element">Improvements</h2><a id="user-content-improvements" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Improvements" href="#improvements"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Clipboard Sticky Header</strong>: Action buttons stay pinned on screen while scrolling long expanded records.</li>
<li>
<strong>Clipboard History Clearing</strong>: Clear button moved beside search bar with morphing delete confirmation.</li>
<li>
<strong>Lyrics Synchronization</strong>: Improved timestamp accuracy and alignment against active media players.</li>
<li>
<strong>Dependencies Bump</strong>: Sparkle 2.10.0, Swift Collections 1.7.0, KeyboardShortcuts 3.1.0, SwiftUIIntrospect 27.0.0.</li>
</ul>
<div class="markdown-heading"><h2 class="heading-element">Bug Fixes</h2><a id="user-content-bug-fixes" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Bug Fixes" href="#bug-fixes"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Fan Control Revert</strong>: Fixed Apple Silicon SMC coprocessor latency causing instant rollback to Auto mode.</li>
<li>
<strong>HUD Wake Reclaim</strong>: Prevented macOS default HUD from re-engaging after sleep/lock screen wake.</li>
<li>
<strong>Clipboard Sort</strong>: Maintained consistent item ordering after notch collapses.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href="https://github.com/jinkun1998/another.notch/compare/v1.2.0...v1.3.0">https://github.com/jinkun1998/another.notch/compare/v1.2.0...v1.3.0</a></p>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/jinkun1998/another.notch/releases/download/v1.3.0/anotherNotch.dmg" length="9472832" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="jHfDrw6UKFnGB1ka8ZJgyGOILCpoKptlgNdbk8AK9lLnOde/bCAP/t0qqmRVloi7Di+GTsXK1THVEcdJqz8+CQ=="/>
        </item>
