        <item>
            <title>1.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 06:47:46 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/jinkun1998/another.notch/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>32</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<div class="markdown-heading"><h1 class="heading-element">anotherNotch v1.2.0</h1><a id="user-content-anothernotch-v120" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: anotherNotch v1.2.0" href="#anothernotch-v120"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<div class="markdown-heading"><h2 class="heading-element">New Features</h2><a id="user-content-new-features" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: New Features" href="#new-features"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>Music lyrics — synced lyrics below music controls, with verified lyric matching.</li>
<li>Lunar calendar — Vietnamese lunar dates in Calendar.</li>
<li>Tab shortcuts — global keyboard shortcuts for installed notch modules.</li>
<li>Clipboard improvements — paste selected records into the active app; preview long content.</li>
<li>System HUD controls — choose which macOS HUDs anotherNotch replaces.</li>
<li>Update check — menu bar action to manually check for updates.</li>
<li>Homebrew Cask — install anotherNotch from Homebrew.</li>
</ul>
<div class="markdown-heading"><h2 class="heading-element">Optimizations</h2><a id="user-content-optimizations" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Optimizations" href="#optimizations"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>Reduced open-notch redraw work for music lyrics, progress, and waveform effects.</li>
<li>Smoother notch resizing and stable music-control positioning.</li>
<li>Improved notch sizing options consistency across display types.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
